---
// src/components/AboutBrand.astro
---

<!-- ==================== CERITA & KETENTERAMAN (TENTANG PROPERTI & SYARIAH) ==================== -->
<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-surface-canvas border-b border-border-stone scroll-mt-20 relative" id="tentang">
  
  <!-- Subtle Ambient Glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-12 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-syariah-gold/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 xs:px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start relative">
      
      <!-- Sisi Kiri: Kolom Terpisah Mengambang & Sticky Centered (5 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:sticky lg:top-[max(6.5rem,calc(50vh-220px))] lg:self-start transition-all">
        <!-- Kartu Terpisah Mengambang (*Floating Luxury Card*) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-9 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <!-- Eyebrow Badge -->
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-syariah-gold/10 border border-syariah-gold/30 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold mb-4">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-syariah-gold animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>Nilai Dasar &amp; Filosofi Hunian</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Editorial Heading -->
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl xs:text-3xl sm:text-[2rem] lg:text-[2.2rem] font-normal leading-[1.25] text-on-surface tracking-tight">
              Mengutamakan Adab Bertamu, Ketenangan Batin, dan Kebersihan yang Terjaga.
            </h2>

            <!-- Elegant Gold Divider Line -->
            <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-syariah-gold/60 my-5 sm:my-6"></div>

            <!-- Story Narrative -->
            <div class="space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-justify">
              <p>
                Grha Vege Jawi Syariah dibangun berlandaskan satu niat tulus: menyediakan tempat singgah di Yogyakarta yang tidak sekadar menyewakan kamar tidur, melainkan menghidupkan suasana rumah yang menenangkan jiwa, memuliakan tamu, dan menjaga kehormatan keluarga.
              </p>
              <p class="text-on-surface-variant/90">
                Dengan kapasitas terbatas hanya <strong class="text-on-surface font-semibold">6 kamar tidur privat</strong>, Anda dan keluarga terbebas dari kebisingan lalu-lalang tamu massal. Suasana hening, lingkungan bersih, dan tata ruang yang santun menjadikan istirahat Anda benar-benar pulih dan tenteram.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Authentic Property Reassurance Footer -->
          <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-border-stone/60 text-[11px] font-mono text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-medium text-primary">Penginapan Ramah Keluarga &amp; Akademisi</span>
            <span class="text-syariah-gold font-semibold">Banguntapan, Bantul</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sisi Kanan: 3 Floating Ambient Pillar Cards yang Dapat Di-Scroll (7 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-7">
        
        <!-- Pilar 01: Mushola & Wudhu -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">mosque</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold bg-primary-light px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Kekhusyukan Ibadah</span>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xl font-light text-primary/40">01</span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-on-surface mt-1">
              Mushola Representatif &amp; Tempat Wudhu Air Jernih
            </h3>
            
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-justify">
              Ruang ibadah khusus di lantai dalam guesthouse beralaskan karpet suci yang lembut, dilengkapi sajadah terawat, mukena wangi, sarung, dan penunjuk arah kiblat presisi. Akses tempat wudhu khusus dengan air mengalir jernih dan lantai kesat tidak licin, memudahkan sholat lima waktu berjamaah tanpa tergesa-gesa.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 pt-3.5 border-t border-border-stone/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-primary font-medium">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
              Di dalam rumah • Suasana hening
            </span>
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant/70">Tersedia Mukena &amp; Sajadah</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 02: Syariah & Adab -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-secondary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">verified_user</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-semibold bg-surface-subtle px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border-stone">Adab &amp; Privasi</span>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xl font-light text-secondary/40">02</span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-on-surface mt-1">
              Lingkungan Terjaga Khusus Pasangan Sah &amp; Keluarga
            </h3>
            
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-justify">
              Kami konsisten menerapkan aturan syariat secara santun dan profesional. Tamu berpasangan wajib merupakan pasangan suami-istri yang sah (ditunjukkan dengan KTP sealamat atau Buku Nikah resmi). Seluruh area kamar dan koridor adalah zona bebas asap rokok, minuman keras, dan zat terlarang demi kenyamanan putra-putri dan orang tua Anda.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 pt-3.5 border-t border-border-stone/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-secondary font-medium">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
              Zona 100% bebas asap rokok
            </span>
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant/70">Amanah &amp; Nyaman</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 03: Hening & Dapur Mini -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-syariah-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">soup_kitchen</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-syariah-gold font-semibold bg-gold-subtle/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-syariah-gold/30">Serasa di Rumah</span>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xl font-light text-syariah-gold/50">03</span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-on-surface mt-1">
              Kenyamanan Hangat Layaknya Rumah Sendiri
            </h3>
            
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-justify">
              Hunian yang dirancang agar Anda merasa senyaman di rumah sendiri. Disediakan area dapur mini bersama lengkap dengan kulkas, kompor, dispenser air minum higienis gratis, serta fasilitas seduhan hangat kapan pun Anda ingin bersantai bersama keluarga setelah bepergian.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 pt-3.5 border-t border-border-stone/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-syariah-gold font-medium">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-syariah-gold" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
              Dapur mini, kulkas &amp; air minum gratis
            </span>
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant/70">Fasilitas Bersama</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
